    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math> (where&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi></math> is the constant of integration), then the range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is"
